; THE NAVAL GATE'S MAP (#301, docs/plans/naval.md 6.2).
;
; WIDTH, HEIGHT AND min_spawn_spacing ARE MEASURED, NOT CHOSEN. The gate
; skips unless the starts occupy more than one walkable component, so a
; map that seats everyone on one island passes leg 1 having proved
; nothing. Change any of the three and re-measure before trusting a run.
;
; What was swept, over 40-60 MATCH seeds (the seed regenerates the
; terrain; sweeping spawn_seed instead measures placement within ONE
; world and reports every size healthy - the first sweep did exactly
; that and was wrong):
;
;   112x128 spacing 18  60/60 seated, 60/60 in one sea component,
;                       2..8 landmasses, seats 0-3 NEVER share one  <-- shipped
;   112x128 spacing 12  seats 0-3 share one island on some seeds
;   112x128 spacing 22  same, over 60 seeds (a 20-seed run passed: luck)
;   168x194 any spacing FAILS - the shipped map size is NOT safe here.
;                       More islands exist, but the largest holds four
;                       starts, so on some seeds all four bots begin
;                       together and no landing is possible.
;
; SEATS 0-3 SPECIFICALLY, because `test-load 4` seats bots on 0-3 rather
; than on a random four. A map whose eight starts span four islands can
; still put the first four on one, and then the gate is vacuous for
; exactly the run people execute.
;
; The spacing response is NON-MONOTONIC (placement is rejection
; sampling), so this is a measured band and not a derived constant.
; `tests/test_isles_map.gd` is what defends it.
;
; `preset` is load-bearing too: without it `--map=res://maps/isles.tres`
; generates a CONTINENTS world at these dimensions - one landmass, and a
; gate that passes green having tested nothing.

[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MapConfig" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://map_config.gd" id="1_mapcfg"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_mapcfg")
id = &"isles"
display_name = "Isles"
preset = &"islands"
width = 112
height = 128
hex_size = 1.0
squads_per_player = 12
squad_cap = 40
symmetry_order = 1
player_slots = 8
min_spawn_spacing = 18
min_spawn_landmass = 96
spawn_seed = 20260828
